('12-M2A-CN-0013','TS-Inter-2,MPC,JEE','Mathematics','Complex Numbers','Addition','Easy',0,NULL,'(3+2i) + (1+4i) = ','4+6i','4+2i','2+6i','3+8i','A','Add real and imaginary parts separately.',NULL,1,NOW()),
