('12-M2A-CN-0019','TS-Inter-2,MPC,JEE','Mathematics','Complex Numbers','Euler','Hard',0,NULL,'Euler formula: e^(iθ) = ','cosθ+i·sinθ','cosθ−i·sinθ','sinθ+i·cosθ','1','A','Connects exponential and trigonometric functions.',NULL,1,NOW()),
