('12-M2A-CN-0021','TS-Inter-2,MPC,JEE','Mathematics','Complex Numbers','Rotation','Hard',0,NULL,'Multiplying z by i rotates it by','90° counterclockwise','180°','45°','No rotation','A','i = e^(iπ/2), rotation by π/2.',NULL,1,NOW()),
